Source: gst-plugins-rs-webrtc
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Chris <goabonga@pm.me>
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/goabonga/gst-plugins-rs-rpi
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/goabonga/gst-plugins-rs-rpi.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/goabonga/gst-plugins-rs-rpi
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: gst-plugins-rs-webrtc
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends:
# Resolved by dpkg-shlibdeps against the OS the package is built for, which is
# why a package is built per target OS rather than once for all of them.
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
# webrtcsink and whipsink instantiate webrtcbin, which ships in the plugins-bad
# *plugin* package. shlibs:Depends only sees the libraries the .so links
# against, so this one has to be declared by hand.
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad
Recommends:
# webrtcbin needs libnice's GStreamer plugin for ICE.
 gstreamer1.0-nice
Description: GStreamer Rust WebRTC plugins (webrtcsrc/webrtcsink)
 Pre-built WebRTC elements from the gst-plugins-rs Rust bindings
 (gst-plugin-webrtc and gst-plugin-webrtchttp): webrtcsrc, webrtcsink,
 whipsink, whepsrc and the associated signallers.
 .
 The plugins install into the GStreamer multi-arch plugin directory and are
 discovered automatically -- no GST_PLUGIN_PATH needed.
 .
 Built from upstream tag gstreamer-@UPSTREAM_VERSION@ against the GStreamer
 headers of this distribution release.
